# Build context for `docker build` (local and Hugging Face Spaces).
# Mirrors .gcloudignore: an allow-list, so data, study files, virtual
# environments and generated artifacts never enter the image.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!backend
!frontend

backend/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pdf
**/*.xls
**/*.xlsx
**/*.csv
**/*.wlg
**/*.parquet
**/*.docx
**/*.png
